# mosquitto/conf/acl — QM-WX MQTT ACL 范式
# 参考 docs/research/mosquitto-vivo-bridge.md §3.4
#
# 规则：
#   - 每个 device 只 pub 自己的 topic: device/{userId}-{vendor}-{deviceId}/data
#   - qmwx-server 只 read 全部 device topic
#   - qmwx-admin 只 read admin topic (后续 V0.3.1+ 实施)
#
# 生成密码：
#   docker run --rm -it eclipse-mosquitto:2.0 mosquitto_passwd -c /tmp/passwd <username>
# 然后将生成的 password_hash 复制到 /opt/qm-wx/mosquitto/conf/passwd
# （容器启动时 read-only mount 进 /mosquitto/config/passwd）

# ===== 默认拒绝所有 =====
#
# 注：mosquitto ACL 默认拒绝（无需显式写），但显式 deny 便于审计

# ===== qmwx-server（最高权限，read all device topic）=====
user qmwx-server
topic read device/+/+/+
topic read $SYS/#

# ===== qmwx-admin（待 V0.3.1 实施 admin 服务时启用）=====
# user qmwx-admin
# topic read device/+/+/+
# topic read admin/#

# ===== VIVO 手环 Bridge 账号示例（每个 device 一个，name=userId-vendor-deviceId）=====
# 生成：docker run --rm eclipse-mosquitto:2.0 mosquitto_passwd -c /tmp/passwd device-u1-vivo-watch
# 然后追加到 passwd 文件

# user device-u1-vivo-watch
# topic write device/u1-vivo-watch/data
# topic read device/u1-vivo-watch/cmd

# ===== Terra Bridge 账号（待签约后实施）=====
# user device-terra-bridge
# topic read device/+/+/+
# topic write device/terra-sync/#